n{aligned}{∮}_{∂D}F\\cdot \\text{d}r & ={∮}_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r-{∮}_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r+{∮}_{{C}_{3}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r \\\\  & =\\frac{17}{2}-(- \\frac{19}{3})+(- \\frac{1}{3}) \\\\  & =\\frac{51-(-38)+(-2)}{6} \\\\  & =\\frac{29}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186543836 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a0015fc8-88b5-5637-806e-0694134e0bbc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{11}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543826} {:answer/id #uuid "bbea5b3d-93cf-5bdb-b3b9-dc8d398f6a5f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{47}{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543830} {:answer/id #uuid "e0d1bfe2-984f-576e-a3ec-0532fcc4e3e1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\frac{47}{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543833} {:answer/id #uuid "e971687d-bfd0-50d9-822f-623b570efa14" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\frac{89}{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543835} {:answer/id #uuid "fa61e5ce-3036-5c2e-9dab-860447db6fed" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543839}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e0d1bfe2-984f-576e-a3ec-0532fcc4e3e1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\frac{47}{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543833} :answer-field/id #uuid "99656766-dc06-5ada-8132-f7b86b695e08" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543824}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "f0468836-7eb8-505a-98df-3234db3c120b" :question/problem "![](images/1f/1f308d1a3ecf3bd0090e22c4f70389311db4db3ff06f7038db0cf7770a8837c7.png)\n\nSuppose that $F$ is a vector field on ${R}^{2}$ defined over the region $D$ above. Given that \n\n$$\n{∮}_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r=- \\frac{7}{2},\\,{∮}_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r=- \\frac{14}{3},\\,{∮}_{{C}_{3}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r=\\frac{20}{3},\n$$\n\nwhere ${C}_{1}$ and ${C}_{2}$ are oriented clockwise and ${C}_{3}$ is oriented counterclockwise, calculate the value of ${∮}_{∂D}F\\cdot \\text{d}r.$" :question/worked-solution "To calculate the total circulation of a vector field over the boundary of a region containing holes, we add together the circulations over each *positively oriented* boundary.\n\nRemember that:\n\n- the positive direction is *counterclockwise* for the *outer* curve ${C}_{1}$ (because the region $D$ is always on the left as we traverse ${C}_{1}$ counterclockwise), and\n\n- the positive direction is *clockwise* for the *inner* curves ${C}_{2}$ and ${C}_{3}$ (because the region $D$ is always on the left as we traverse ${C}_{2}$ and ${C}_{3}$ clockwise).\n\nThe diagram below shows the positive orientations of all three curves.\n\n![](images/2b/2bed1b367cd101e0e90674c619ad87da8c90744df570eeea4d9b0333ccee0de1.png)\n\nNotice that the positive orientations of the outer curve ${C}_{1}$ and the inner curve ${C}_{3}$ are opposite those stated in the question.\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∮}_{∂D}F\\cdot \\text{d}r & =-{∮}_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r+{∮}_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r-{∮}_{{C}_{3}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r \\\\  & =-(- \\frac{7}{2})+(- \\frac{14}{3})-\\frac{20}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{-(-21)+(-28)-40}{6} \\\\  & =- \\frac{47}{6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186544015 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cbb58a5e-aca0-59c4-912f-79726bee9634" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{4\\sqrt{3}}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544054}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cbb58a5e-aca0-59c4-912f-79726bee9634" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{4\\sqrt{3}}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544054} :answer-field/id #uuid "dea7cd5a-b58b-58d0-9d87-50e8f2bc76db" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544058}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "0271a4be-2e1b-5236-8901-8d8148db0863" :question/problem "Suppose $|\\,a\\,|=\\frac{8}{3}$ and the angle between vectors $a$ and $b$ is $\\theta =\\frac{5\\pi }{6}.$ Find the scalar projection of $a$ onto $b.$\n\n${\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Using the formula for the scalar projection, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a & =|\\,a\\,|\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{3}cos\\,(\\frac{5\\pi }{6}) \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{3}\\cdot (-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{4\\sqrt{3}}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186544016 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "377c6d11-a7a7-5f20-ba84-76c30ccac924" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544024} {:answer/id #uuid "a2ddacf4-9a0d-5239-beb0-73314a47214f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544041} {:answer/id #uuid "ca910b8a-3d59-557b-ba4f-f2b85fcc6242" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4\\sqrt{3}}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544052} {:answer/id #uuid "e12a00cf-23e1-5372-9913-b6aab316b001" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{4}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544060} {:answer/id #uuid "fc9686b8-dc48-5192-9b13-fc687d782667" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{8}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544066}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e12a00cf-23e1-5372-9913-b6aab316b001" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{4}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544060} :answer-field/id #uuid "52ec4aa6-ec74-57c8-ba94-d2f1f232e5b5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544030}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "0d94e22f-d77e-5143-a145-e612cf090a46" :question/problem "Suppose $|\\,a\\,|=\\frac{8}{3}$ and the angle between vectors $a$ and $b$ is $\\theta ={120}^{∘}.$ Find the scalar projection of $a$ onto $b.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the formula for the scalar projection, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a & =|\\,a\\,|\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡({120}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{3}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{4}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186544029 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "21dcbf1e-95fe-5861-b267-8fd9bba617e2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{13\\sqrt{6}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544019}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "21dcbf1e-95fe-5861-b267-8fd9bba617e2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{13\\sqrt{6}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544019} :answer-field/id #uuid "df2ca04f-d6ae-5f52-bafe-c833132086ec" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186544059}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "5178e3f5-c8fd-52bb-a8fd-c681d5274952" :question